      "text": "Legendaddy breaks down the renewed debate on NCAP and odd-even traffic schemes in Metro Manila.\n\nJames Deakin, Rovilson Fernandez, and @raffylegendaddy point to unresolved issues—delayed notices, outdated data, and unclear implementation—as key concerns for everyday motorists.\n\nIs Metro Manila traffic being managed—or just micromanaged?\n\nRead more on Peanut Gallery News:\n\nhttps://t.co/foK81ATyU0",
